      },
      "text": "Molnupiravir (EIDD-2801): N4-hydroxycytidine prodrug\n                              Mutagenic: incorporated as both C and U → transitions\n                              Oral; approved for COVID-19; ~30% hospitalization reduction\n                              Concern: potential mutagenicity — ongoing monitoring"
    },
